{"id":"wb-3-101","name":"“治世玄岳”牌坊","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"“治世玄岳”牌坊","text":"“治世玄岳”牌坊位于中国湖北省丹江口市武当山街道玄岳村（实际由武当山旅游经济特区管辖），俗称玄岳门，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n“治世玄岳”牌坊建于明嘉靖三十一年（1552年），清乾隆二十年（1755年）修缮。牌坊坐西朝东，为四柱三间五楼仿木结构石牌坊，宽14.5米，高11.9米。匾上双面均刻有嘉靖皇帝敕额“治世玄岳”四字，故而得名。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E2%80%9C%E6%B2%BB%E4%B8%96%E7%8E%84%E5%B2%B3%E2%80%9D%E7%89%8C%E5%9D%8A","revisionId":90815889,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90815889","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b071971f2c4547de660ca817.jpg","title":"武当山玄武门.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%AD%A6%E5%BD%93%E5%B1%B1%E7%8E%84%E6%AD%A6%E9%97%A8.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/%E6%AD%A6%E5%BD%93%E5%B1%B1%E7%8E%84%E6%AD%A6%E9%97%A8.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​武当山玄武门","width":320,"height":240}}